                    r.familyRecordHash,
                    r.storageIdentifierHash,
                    r.writer,
                    r.observedAt
                )
            );
        }
        hash = assemblyArchive.recordReceipt(
            r, locator, _ocSign(writerKey, assemblyArchive.receiptDigest(r))
